 "basis": "sized as a light-to-midsize business jet or a fast jet drone: 15-20 m long, MTOW ~8.5 t; Mach 0.6-0.8 (215 m/s low, 245 m/s high); a minimum speed of ~70 m/s (its stall, clean); load factor 2.5 at low level (transport-category limit), 1.5 sustainable near its ceiling; roll ~90 deg/s; climb ~25 m/s; thrust/weight ~0.35 (accelerating ~2.5 m/s2 at low speed). RCS of a bizjet (~1 m2 nose-on, ~10 beam); IR of a small turbofan's nozzle (~700 K). The winged spindle and its flight are fiction."
